   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanley_Road",
   "resumo_en": "Stanley Road is the third solo studio album by the English singer-songwriter and musician Paul Weller, released on 15 May 1995 by Go! Discs. The album took its name from the street in Woking where Weller grew up. Weller's cover version of the song \"I Walk on Guilded Splinters\" was featured in the series ending montage of The Wire's fourth series end, \"Final Grades\".\nOn 30 May 2005, a three-disc 10th anniversary deluxe edition of the album was released by Island Records. The expanded edition included demos, live and BBC session recordings and a DVD documentary directed by Simon Halfon which featured interviews, behind-the-scenes footage and music videos.",
